(6908768, 1041749, 100975, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t there, so I don''t know, but it seems like you could have made more traingles out of this.  This may have been exactly what you wanted, but I am a little confused by it.  The main focal point resembles a parallelogram.</td>', 'I wasn''t there, so I don''t know, but it seems like you could have made more traingles out of this.  This may have been exactly what you wanted, but I am a little confused by it.  The main focal point resembles a parallelogram.', '2012-11-19 01:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
