(6909128, 1041715, 124190, '<td valign="top">I have to stop here....in my voting.   Clearly this is "THE" triangle shot of the challenge. Couple observations/criticisms cuz it''s just calling to me. IMHO Because there is no obvious table line or suspension line, the fact that it looks like it''s floating in black makes me like it.......the masking tape makes me want to beg you to edit it more and make it as white as the straws and/or dodge/burn it so you can''t see it or at least get rid of the jagged edges......cuz you can do that in this level challenge, right?  I might also re-shoot it paying more attention to the negative spaces around the structure.... which if made more triangular could really make this the strongest shot. I took the time here to comment in length cuz I really like this.....and you made an effort, and it''s really inspiring.   I can picture the hands working on the straw structure.....WITH LOTS OF STICKY TAPE!!!!</td>', 'I have to stop here....in my voting.   Clearly this is "THE" triangle shot of the challenge. Couple observations/criticisms cuz it''s just calling to me. IMHO Because there is no obvious table line or suspension line, the fact that it looks like it''s floating in black makes me like it.......the masking tape makes me want to beg you to edit it more and make it as white as the straws and/or dodge/burn it so you can''t see it or at least get rid of the jagged edges......cuz you can do that in this level challenge, right?  I might also re-shoot it paying more attention to the negative spaces around the structure.... which if made more triangular could really make this the strongest shot. I took the time here to comment in length cuz I really like this.....and you made an effort, and it''s really inspiring.   I can picture the hands working on the straw structure.....WITH LOTS OF STICKY TAPE!!!!', '2012-11-19 12:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6909130, 1041743, 124190, '<td valign="top">......drooool..............</td>', '......drooool..............', '2012-11-19 12:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
