(6911885, 1041614, 69034, '<td valign="top">Excellent, and solid shot for the challenge.  Simple in form, and subtle.  I love the slow fade as the picture travels left.</td>', 'Excellent, and solid shot for the challenge.  Simple in form, and subtle.  I love the slow fade as the picture travels left.', '2012-11-23 11:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911887, 1041529, 69034, '<td valign="top">I had this same idea, but just could not find a way to pull it off.  The lens distortion seems to be pulling everything left, and I''m sure some are not happy with that.  In any case, it is nice to see this.</td>', 'I had this same idea, but just could not find a way to pull it off.  The lens distortion seems to be pulling everything left, and I''m sure some are not happy with that.  In any case, it is nice to see this.', '2012-11-23 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911890, 1041751, 69034, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  The processing of the sky is very impressive to me despite the "editing" halo and the noise in the clouds.  It actually seems to add ot this shot due to the clarity of shape and color in the house.  Maybe this is me, but it seems as if the steps are slightly off kilter?  But regardless, you picked a great subject and shot it at a great time.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  The processing of the sky is very impressive to me despite the "editing" halo and the noise in the clouds.  It actually seems to add ot this shot due to the clarity of shape and color in the house.  Maybe this is me, but it seems as if the steps are slightly off kilter?  But regardless, you picked a great subject and shot it at a great time.', '2012-11-23 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911891, 1041707, 69034, '<td valign="top">Simple.  Beautiful.  Gentle and Bold at the same time.</td>', 'Simple.  Beautiful.  Gentle and Bold at the same time.', '2012-11-23 11:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
