(6911894, 1041741, 69034, '<td valign="top">Indeed.  Love the tone on this shot, and the rule of thirds is very present here.  Well done.</td>', 'Indeed.  Love the tone on this shot, and the rule of thirds is very present here.  Well done.', '2012-11-23 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911898, 1041648, 69034, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject and love the simple lines of the picture.  Contrast yellow against black is also very attractive.</td>', 'Excellent subject and love the simple lines of the picture.  Contrast yellow against black is also very attractive.', '2012-11-23 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911899, 1041676, 69034, '<td valign="top">The only thing I have to say about this picture that could have improved it, would have been to add a different colored background.  Mayhaps a red that fades through a color similar to the olive stuffing?  However, in any case, people don''t realize how difficult a good "glass" shot can be.  I also like the use of circles within the "triangle".</td>', 'The only thing I have to say about this picture that could have improved it, would have been to add a different colored background.  Mayhaps a red that fades through a color similar to the olive stuffing?  However, in any case, people don''t realize how difficult a good "glass" shot can be.  I also like the use of circles within the "triangle".', '2012-11-23 11:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911901, 1041661, 69034, '<td valign="top">Well found.  Well shot.  Excellent Macro that fits the challenge.</td>', 'Well found.  Well shot.  Excellent Macro that fits the challenge.', '2012-11-23 11:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911902, 1041635, 69034, '<td valign="top">I like the soft fade in this picture, and the way in adds to the shape.</td>', 'I like the soft fade in this picture, and the way in adds to the shape.', '2012-11-23 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911904, 1041527, 69034, '<td valign="top">Has someone tapped The Master''s name in a piece of work.  It appears so, but I feel he would appreciate the math in this shot.  Excellent contrast.</td>', 'Has someone tapped The Master''s name in a piece of work.  It appears so, but I feel he would appreciate the math in this shot.  Excellent contrast.', '2012-11-23 11:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911907, 1041743, 69034, '<td valign="top">Like the shot, and the subject appears to be well lit, however, I have found it best when shooting, to use a piece of glass that is back-lit instead of a cloth as my attention is immediately drawn to the cloth in foreground and not the pie.  In any case, worthy attempt.</td>', 'Like the shot, and the subject appears to be well lit, however, I have found it best when shooting, to use a piece of glass that is back-lit instead of a cloth as my attention is immediately drawn to the cloth in foreground and not the pie.  In any case, worthy attempt.', '2012-11-23 11:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911912, 1041721, 69034, '<td valign="top">First of these shots I have run into with 92% of the challenge voted on.  Appreciate the "creation" of triangles very much, and the background has a statement as well as being pleasing.  Artistic use of noise. Well Done.</td>', 'First of these shots I have run into with 92% of the challenge voted on.  Appreciate the "creation" of triangles very much, and the background has a statement as well as being pleasing.  Artistic use of noise. Well Done.', '2012-11-23 11:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911930, 1041531, 69034, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Triangle in the composition of the image as well a subject.  Well done.  And of course, I am a sucker for a good water shot.</td>', 'Good shot.  Triangle in the composition of the image as well a subject.  Well done.  And of course, I am a sucker for a good water shot.', '2012-11-23 11:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911932, 1041618, 69034, '<td valign="top">Neat triangles.  My only complaint on this shot is the saturation is a bit heavy.  I know you were likely trying to bring out colors in the sky and add contrast the pillars, but at a certain point when I did this, I realized I was starting to dip away from reality. . .which a lot of photogs see the minute they pull up a picture.  Worthy Effort.</td>', 'Neat triangles.  My only complaint on this shot is the saturation is a bit heavy.  I know you were likely trying to bring out colors in the sky and add contrast the pillars, but at a certain point when I did this, I realized I was starting to dip away from reality. . .which a lot of photogs see the minute they pull up a picture.  Worthy Effort.', '2012-11-23 12:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911935, 1041725, 69034, '<td valign="top">These shots are very popular here, and while neat I was not a fan of the black and white.  However, this adhered to the challenge well, and looked fun to shoot.  Overall a pleasing image.</td>', 'These shots are very popular here, and while neat I was not a fan of the black and white.  However, this adhered to the challenge well, and looked fun to shoot.  Overall a pleasing image.', '2012-11-23 12:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911936, 1041630, 69034, '<td valign="top">I am sensing the gods of "selective dodge and burn"  though in this case they were well used to make the triangle the focus of the shot.  I like the off kilter angle as well.  Nice.</td>', 'I am sensing the gods of "selective dodge and burn"  though in this case they were well used to make the triangle the focus of the shot.  I like the off kilter angle as well.  Nice.', '2012-11-23 12:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6911976, 1041724, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much - like the fact that you included just a bit of the chain link on the left and the lighting that gave such a clear shadow pattern on the backs of the jeans.  I gave this a 5 because I like it and it is a geometric shape :)  However, I call this shape a diamond - could even go with square or rectangle - and not a triangle, so it doesn''t get the score it would have in a Diamond, Square or Rectangle challenge.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I like this shot very much - like the fact that you included just a bit of the chain link on the left and the lighting that gave such a clear shadow pattern on the backs of the jeans.  I gave this a 5 because I like it and it is a geometric shape :)  However, I call this shape a diamond - could even go with square or rectangle - and not a triangle, so it doesn''t get the score it would have in a Diamond, Square or Rectangle challenge.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-23 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912056, 1041236, 67258, '<td valign="top">The written word - an opening to the world; the expansion of knowledge direct from the book - really well illustrated concept.</td>', 'The written word - an opening to the world; the expansion of knowledge direct from the book - really well illustrated concept.', '2012-11-23 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912058, 1041655, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good idea, and technicals are very good, but in the end, the pose looks forced and uncomfortable.</td>', 'A good idea, and technicals are very good, but in the end, the pose looks forced and uncomfortable.', '2012-11-23 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912103, 1041726, 138630, '<td valign="top">So unusual - should be creepy but it''s not in the least.  I love the implied triangle - my favorite part is probably the hand.  I like that this is on a distressed and reflective surface, too, so it has a base and is not simply floating.  Excellent in black and white.  One of my top two.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'So unusual - should be creepy but it''s not in the least.  I love the implied triangle - my favorite part is probably the hand.  I like that this is on a distressed and reflective surface, too, so it has a base and is not simply floating.  Excellent in black and white.  One of my top two.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-23 18:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912104, 1041676, 138630, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors, clean and simple.  I don''t like martinis but I would sure give this one a try :)  Top two for me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors, clean and simple.  I don''t like martinis but I would sure give this one a try :)  Top two for me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-23 18:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912105, 1041500, 138630, '<td valign="top">There probably won''t be enough of a triangle here for some but I think it''s fine!  I like that the sun gives us a natural reason for the hand-shading-the-eyes pose.  Top ten for me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'There probably won''t be enough of a triangle here for some but I think it''s fine!  I like that the sun gives us a natural reason for the hand-shading-the-eyes pose.  Top ten for me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-23 18:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912106, 1041487, 138630, '<td valign="top">Such fun glasses - I always enjoy compositions using them, especially if they are nice and clean and clear as this one is.  How about that triangle of white where the liquid in the front glass cuts across the back two.  Nicely set up.  Top ten for me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Such fun glasses - I always enjoy compositions using them, especially if they are nice and clean and clear as this one is.  How about that triangle of white where the liquid in the front glass cuts across the back two.  Nicely set up.  Top ten for me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-23 18:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
