(6912435, 1041575, 141319, '<td valign="top">Nice, very moody. Love the triangle. Perhaps trying to eliminate some of the "haze" on both the front and the sky would have improved the image?</td>', 'Nice, very moody. Love the triangle. Perhaps trying to eliminate some of the "haze" on both the front and the sky would have improved the image?', '2012-11-24 13:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912439, 1041647, 141319, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the fact that you used the B&amp;W in the BG. I would have still darkened it a bit more (the BG I mean) Lovely colors on the FG structure.</td>', 'Nice, I like the fact that you used the B&W in the BG. I would have still darkened it a bit more (the BG I mean) Lovely colors on the FG structure.', '2012-11-24 13:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912441, 1041391, 141319, '<td valign="top">Hmmm ... triangle only just barely there for me.</td>', 'Hmmm ... triangle only just barely there for me.', '2012-11-24 13:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912443, 1041632, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very nice crop. I would have liked to see more detail in those deep shadow areas.</td>', 'Very nice crop. I would have liked to see more detail in those deep shadow areas.', '2012-11-24 13:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912445, 1041667, 141319, '<td valign="top">Strictly speaking your shape is a pentagon, not a triangle ...</td>', 'Strictly speaking your shape is a pentagon, not a triangle ...', '2012-11-24 13:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912448, 1041572, 141319, '<td valign="top">Ilike this image a lot. Like the composition, coloring, pp, sun rays ... everything ... except the shape is not a triangle, its a quadrilateral :-(.</td>', 'Ilike this image a lot. Like the composition, coloring, pp, sun rays ... everything ... except the shape is not a triangle, its a quadrilateral :-(.', '2012-11-24 13:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912450, 1041735, 141319, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2012-11-24 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912462, 1041715, 141319, '<td valign="top">I love this and what I am going to say next probably sounds terribly pernickety, but for such a "clean" image, your construction should have been more meticulous. those bits of tape really spoil it for me</td>', 'I love this and what I am going to say next probably sounds terribly pernickety, but for such a "clean" image, your construction should have been more meticulous. those bits of tape really spoil it for me', '2012-11-24 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6912463, 1041573, 141319, '<td valign="top">I hope you are going to tell us what this is - very interesting composition. I am thinking that a much tighter crop may have worked better?</td>', 'I hope you are going to tell us what this is - very interesting composition. I am thinking that a much tighter crop may have worked better?', '2012-11-24 13:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
