(6912468, 1041676, 141319, '<td valign="top">Shaken not stirred I hope ;-) ... very, nice. Small niggly comment is that odd shadow on the left top of the liquid. I can see its also triangluar, but I don''t think it should be there.</td>', 'Shaken not stirred I hope ;-) ... very, nice. Small niggly comment is that odd shadow on the left top of the liquid. I can see its also triangluar, but I don''t think it should be there.', '2012-11-24 13:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
