(6913268, 1041496, 112739, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but I do not see any triangles. I am assuming the pier posts are meant to be seen as an abstract triangle, but to me, it is not strong enough to be seen as that. If I was looking at this image without knowing the challenge, triangle would not be the first thing presented.</td>', 'I like the image, but I do not see any triangles. I am assuming the pier posts are meant to be seen as an abstract triangle, but to me, it is not strong enough to be seen as that. If I was looking at this image without knowing the challenge, triangle would not be the first thing presented.', '2012-11-25 21:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
