(6913502, 1041665, 144365, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this a Venser?<br/> <br/>Looks like it could use some teeth sharpening, those chompers just aren''t vicious enough. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Never know if my name drop is good or bad.<br/>I was just going through all the entries I gave a vote of 7 or higher to (seven entries) and reading the comments. This obviously was one of them. I really liked it because it was different. I only gave it a 7 because it was a little too OOF and grainy for my liking with regards to this subject and composition. I still found it much better than a lot of other entries though, good job.</td>', 'Originally posted by giantmike: Is this a Venser? Looks like it could use some teeth sharpening, those chompers just aren''t vicious enough.  Never know if my name drop is good or bad.I was just going through all the entries I gave a vote of 7 or higher to (seven entries) and reading the comments. This obviously was one of them. I really liked it because it was different. I only gave it a 7 because it was a little too OOF and grainy for my liking with regards to this subject and composition. I still found it much better than a lot of other entries though, good job.', '2012-11-26 09:01:41.000000', NULL, 0),
