(6914990, 1041551, 135697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by emoons:</b></div><hr/><i> Seems like the lighting is off to me.  I know the point of interest is well...the point of interest, but there were some details in this photo that could have been more pronounced.  For instance, the details in the hat (since it is covering the point of interest).  Maybe you would want to draw the eyes in a little more. Smaller hat to give more of a triangular effect?  It is hard to see the fishnet for what it is.  Not that you would want giant panties, but the bra on the feet seems a little off to me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>+1 maybe top twenty</td>', 'Originally posted by emoons: Seems like the lighting is off to me.  I know the point of interest is well...the point of interest, but there were some details in this photo that could have been more pronounced.  For instance, the details in the hat (since it is covering the point of interest).  Maybe you would want to draw the eyes in a little more. Smaller hat to give more of a triangular effect?  It is hard to see the fishnet for what it is.  Not that you would want giant panties, but the bra on the feet seems a little off to me.   +1 maybe top twenty', '2012-11-28 09:01:55.000000', NULL, 0),
